---
import Layout from '../components/layout/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Project Kabir - Your AI-powered travel companion">
  <Section background="white" padding="large">
    <div class="privacy-policy-container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="policy-meta">
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> March 20, 2025</p>
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> March 20, 2025</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-intro">
        <p>Welcome to Kabir, your AI-powered travel companion. Your privacy is important to us, and this Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your data while using our services.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you use Kabir, we may collect the following types of data:</p>
        
        <h3>a) Personal Information (Collected only with user consent)</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Name, Email, Phone Number (if signing in with Google, Facebook, Apple ID).</li>
          <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> Real-time location when using travel features (only when permission is granted).</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>b) Non-Personal Information</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> App activity, feature interactions, and preferences.</li>
          <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device model, OS, app version, and analytics for performance improvement.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>c) Conversations with Kabir</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>User Interactions:</strong> AI-powered chats with Kabir are stored for app functionality and service improvements.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Your data is used to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide personalized travel guidance and location-based features.</li>
          <li>Improve Kabir's AI capabilities and user experience.</li>
          <li>Ensure security, detect fraud, and comply with legal requirements.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>3. Data Sharing & Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We may share data with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Cloud Services (Firebase, Google Cloud) for authentication and app functionality.</li>
          <li>Third-Party APIs (e.g., Google Maps, ChatGPT) for navigation and AI responses.</li>
          <li>Legal Authorities if required by law or to prevent fraud/security risks.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>4. Data Security & Retention</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We use encryption, access control, and secure storage to protect your data.</li>
          <li>Personal data is stored securely and retained only as long as necessary.</li>
          <li>Chat history and travel logs may be deleted upon user request.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>5. User Rights & Choices</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access, update, or delete your data via app settings.</li>
          <li>Opt-out of data collection (may affect app features).</li>
          <li>Request a copy of your data by contacting us.</li>
          <li>Request data deletion by reaching out to us at <a href="mailto:sagar@kabir-ai.com">sagar@kabir-ai.com</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>6. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies and analytics tools to enhance user experience but do not track users across external sites.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>7. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be notified via the app or email.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For data deletion requests or any privacy concerns, contact:</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:sagar@kabir-ai.com">sagar@kabir-ai.com</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="https://www.kabir-ai.com">www.kabir-ai.com</a></p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="policy-footer">
        <p>By using Kabir, you agree to this Privacy Policy and our terms of service.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-policy-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  
  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: #333;
  }
  
  .policy-meta {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
  }
  
  .policy-intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .policy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  
  .policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #c2634b;
  }
  
  .policy-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: #333;
  }
  
  .policy-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .policy-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .policy-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  
  a {
    color: #c2634b;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  
  a:hover {
    color: #ad5541;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    
    .policy-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
    }
    
    .policy-section h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>